# AI Career Intelligence System - Environment Variables
# ==========================================================
# For Cross-Device Cloud Synchronization using Supabase:
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the SQL script in /supabase/schema.sql in the Supabase SQL Editor
# 3. Paste your Project URL and anon public key below:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Optional: Custom Centralized Backend API Gateway (defaults to /api)
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-server.com
